("pfizer","Pfizer","https://www.pfizer.com/","Pfizer is a global pharmaceutical company based in New York.","The 2021 symbol is a double helix that also echoes Pfizer's historic pill shape.","An italic script wordmark gives the brand forward motion and a human touch.",[("double helix",0.15,0.2),("old pill shape",0.15,0.85),("italic script",0.7,0.5)]),
