("novartis","Novartis","https://www.novartis.com/","Novartis is a Swiss pharmaceutical company based in Basel.","The symbol is an abstract flame in blue, orange, and yellow, suggesting energy and progress.","A wide, classic serif wordmark in spaced capitals keeps the brand serious and scientific.",[("flame",0.05,0.2),("warm gradient",0.05,0.85),("spaced serif caps",0.6,0.5)]),
("astrazeneca","AstraZeneca","https://www.astrazeneca.com/","AstraZeneca is a British-Swedish pharmaceutical company.","The gold symbol suggests a twisting molecule or a figure in motion.","A plum wordmark with a capital Z joins two company names into one.",[("molecule swirl",0.92,0.2),("gold",0.92,0.85),("plum wordmark",0.3,0.5)]),
("moderna","Moderna","https://www.modernatx.com/","Moderna is a US biotechnology company known for its mRNA medicines and vaccines.","A thin, red lowercase wordmark feels light and modern, like a tech company.","The dotted line underneath suggests a strand of genetic code.",[("thin lowercase",0.3,0.3),("red",0.6,0.2),("code strand",0.5,1.0)]),
("sanofi","Sanofi","https://www.sanofi.com/","Sanofi is a French pharmaceutical company based in Paris.","The 2022 rebrand replaced a colorful bird symbol with a simple black lowercase wordmark.","Two purple dots built into the s are the logo's only color.",[("black lowercase",0.3,0.3),("purple dots",0.04,0.8),("no symbol",0.8,0.85)]),
("gsk","GSK","https://www.gsk.com/","GSK is a British pharmaceutical company, formerly GlaxoSmithKline.","The 2022 rebrand shortened the name to three letters and made them the whole logo.","An orange gradient keeps the brand's heritage color but feels more energetic.",[("three letters",0.2,0.3),("orange gradient",0.6,0.2),("geometric shapes",0.8,0.85)]),
("novo-nordisk","Novo Nordisk","https://www.novonordisk.com/","Novo Nordisk is a Danish pharmaceutical company known for diabetes and obesity medicines.","The Apis bull, an ancient Egyptian symbol, is one of the oldest marks in pharma.","A clean lowercase novo sits next to the bull in deep blue.",[("Apis bull",0.08,0.2),("ancient symbol",0.08,0.85),("lowercase",0.6,0.5)]),
("lilly","Lilly","https://www.lilly.com/","Eli Lilly and Company is a US pharmaceutical company based in Indianapolis.","The red script logo is based on the signature of founder Colonel Eli Lilly.","The long swash under the letters makes the wordmark instantly recognizable.",[("founder's signature",0.2,0.2),("Lilly red",0.6,0.2),("long swash",0.7,0.9)]),
