("siemens-healthineers","Siemens Healthineers","https://www.siemens-healthineers.com/","Siemens Healthineers is the medical technology company of Siemens.","The petrol Siemens wordmark sits above Healthineers in orange.","A cluster of orange dots suggests data, people, or cells coming together.",[("Siemens petrol",0.4,0.15),("orange dots",0.95,0.5),("made-up word",0.3,0.9)]),
