("dexcom","Dexcom","https://www.dexcom.com/","Dexcom makes continuous glucose monitoring systems for people with diabetes.","A green, wide lowercase wordmark has a playful, approachable look.","The descriptor CONTINUOUS GLUCOSE MONITORING tells you the product in the logo.",[("green",0.2,0.3),("wide lowercase",0.6,0.2),("product line",0.5,0.95)]),
