("zocdoc","Zocdoc","https://www.zocdoc.com/","Zocdoc is an online platform for finding and booking doctor appointments.","The yellow symbol is a Z with eyes, a friendly character called Zee.","A heavy dark wordmark keeps the playful symbol grounded.",[("Z with eyes",0.12,0.2),("yellow",0.12,0.85),("heavy wordmark",0.7,0.5)]),
